# L §2.4 Values, E §10 a movement instance (tally 2.1.7 R9, issue #148; F17): the booking cut of an instance
# whose law date is a hole is that hole, `?` with its question. 2.1.6's refcore printed `booking cut None`.
=== c.tally
model f
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "made up"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place kasa: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input d1: date

input lawd: date

input amt: money PLN

move pay: transfers
  at lawd
  on d1
  leg cash from world to kasa amount amt

ask q: explain pay

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 5.00 PLN "the card"
  d1 = 2026-02-01 "the card"
=== expect
q: pay
  plan, day ?"lawd: no value" (lawd), booking cut ?"lawd: no value" (lawd), status hole
  exists: ?"lawd: no value" (lawd)
  cut 2026-03-01
